      ],
      "source": "https://www.beattynv.info/history.html",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The closed Barrick Bullfrog mine near Beatty was selected in 2004 for an EPA pilot reclamation project under the Brownfields Mine-Scarred Land Initiative.",
